Looks pretty good:

You don't really need anything else, but here are some suggestions, if
you really want to cover every option...

- Oilskin cloak for plane of water (or genocide all water
creatures).
- Have a scroll of charging (or two) ready for that wand of wishing.
No reason to need to spend an extra turn writing it.
-You probably have these, but spare lizard corpse? Towel?
- Blessed scrolls of remove curse are a good idea (and weigh less than
water).
- Athame (Wands of fire/lightning are just as good, but this won't run
out of charges).
- Something to hit disenchanters with.
- cursed potion of Gain level (to get out of the sanctum).
- cockatrice eggs (in case Demogorgon shows up?).
- Wand of cancellation in a sack (this could potentially mess you up,
so be careful).
- have a prayer ready.

Again, not mentioned but:

1 wand of SD detection (for finding door in sanctum)
2 wands of digging (for earth, digging out of lava on fire).
1 wand of cold (for lava on Fire)
2-3 wands of fire (Elbereth)
all the wands of teleport/death/wishing you've got.


Remember:

- When possible, jump.  It's faster.
- Scrolls of Teleport don't work in the planes.  Use them to get to
level 1 faster.
- If you get into trouble, stop!  Think it through.  You have plenty
of resources to get out of anything.






